{"4318950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "City of Hunger", "steam_appid": 4318950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4915890], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318950/extras/e179354650af0647ad66f36871d53be0.avif?t=1784135073\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a rescue operation soon reveals something far worse: a deadly parasitic infection linked to Dr. Summers' secret experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned houses, underground laboratories, infested streets, and hidden facilities as you fight to survive in a world descending into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Intense combat against infected creatures and monstrous mutations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318950/extras/01f607b33d4275bf8e6070e32e987390.poster.avif?t=1784135073\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318950/extras/01f607b33d4275bf8e6070e32e987390.webm?t=1784135073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318950/extras/01f607b33d4275bf8e6070e32e987390.mp4?t=1784135073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Diverse weapons, including pistols, rifles, axes, and hammers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318950/extras/9626d80189701d959e005eeb96f88aaf.poster.avif?t=1784135073\" width=1170 h